    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Igizyo lya magambo mav'i ga wu'kwele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“V'awi'le v'ana v'a Izilaeli, ‘Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'du' muv'e muli'v'ezya magambo ki'ti' ago ga ku' nsi' ya Misili, u'ko mwav'age mwikalile, ninga ku'du' muv'e muli'v'ezya magambo ki'ti' ago ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, i'yo ndamufile. Nhana ku'du' mwize mulonde ki'ti'le chav'o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi inywe yi'li'mudima muziku'zye nzi'la zyanne, na ku'zidima nhama zyanne, ki'gele ku'zilonda. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo, muzidime nhama zyanne na nzi'la zyanne. U'yo alazidime alav'e na wu'zuwu'ku. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' ize amwegele mwiye wa igongo lyakwe lya bi'hi' ki'gele alale nawe. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'muv'i'nzi'le isima so ku' ku'lala na nnoko wa ku'ku'v'yala, ku'nguno mwenu'yo ali' nnoko. Ku'du' u'lale nawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na muki' wamwa so, ku' ku'v'ezya vyeni'vi yi'li' ku'muv'i'nzi'la isima so.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na ilu'mbu'yo, mwaniki' mwana wamwa so ninga wamwa nnoko, av'e wa ku'v'yali'lwa mu lu'go lwinywe ninga ku'ngi'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na mwizu'ku'lu' wako, mwaniki' wa ku'v'yalwa na mwana wako, ku'nguno u'li'wiv'i'nzi'la isima ev'e mweni'ki'li'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' wize u'lale na ilu'mbu'yo wa ku'v'yalwa na muki' wamwa so. Mwenu'yo ali' ilu'mbu'yo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ku'du' u'lale na sengiyo. Mwenu'yo ali' mudu'gu' wa bi'hi' ku'mwa so.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
